<view class="page">
  <view class="hero card" style="background:#FFF9E6; border-color:#FDE68A;">
    <view style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:20rpx;">
      <text style="font-size:72rpx;">🦌</text>
      <view>
        <view class="page-title" style="color:#92400E;">今天也一起练习～</view>
        <view class="page-subtitle" style="color:#B45309;">康康小鹿陪您练习：动一动，脚步更轻盈！</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice">
    小程序训练使用云端异步姿态分析：训练视频上传后由服务端生成结果，训练过程中没有实时动作反馈。
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card" aria-role="status">正在加载您的训练概览…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="card">
    <view class="notice notice--danger" aria-role="alert">{{error}}</view>
    <button class="btn btn--secondary" bindtap="loadData">重新加载</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:elif="{{overview && !overview.context.patient}}" class="card">尚未关联患者，请先联系管理员获取绑定码。</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{overview}}" class="section">
    <view class="section-title">{{overview.context.patient.displayName}}，今天也一起加油</view>
    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title">今日打卡 {{overview.todayCount}} 次</view>
      <view class="muted">近 30 天打卡 {{overview.trainingCount}} 次 · 连续坚持 {{overview.streakDays}} 天</view>
      <view class="hint">连续天数按近 30 个自然日统计，今天尚未打卡时从昨天计起。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="section-title">最近训练</view>
    <view wx:if="{{!overview.records.length}}" class="card">近 30 天还没有训练记录，期待您的下一次练习。</view>
    <view wx:for="{{overview.records}}" wx:key="id" class="card">
      <view class="card-title">{{item.recordedAt}}</view>
      <view class="muted">{{item.status}} · 完成动作 {{item.completionCount}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">开始今天的训练</view>
    <navigator
      class="entry"
      url="/pages/training/index"
      open-type="switchTab"
      aria-role="button"
      aria-label="进入训练条目列表"
    >
      <view class="entry__body">
        <view class="entry__title">活力跟练演示</view>
        <view class="entry__desc">查看训练示例与安全提示</view>
      </view>
      <view class="entry__arrow">›</view>
    </navigator>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">常用功能</view>
    <view class="entry-grid">
      <navigator
        class="entry-tile"
        url="/pages/patient/index"
        aria-role="button"
        aria-label="查看活力健康档案"
      >
        <view class="entry-tile__body">
          <view class="entry-tile__title">健康档案</view>
          <view class="entry-tile__desc">查看打卡与坚持记录</view>
        </view>
        <view class="entry-tile__arrow">›</view>
      </navigator>

      <navigator
        class="entry-tile"
        url="/pages/assessment/index"
        aria-role="button"
        aria-label="进入身体感受记录"
      >
        <view class="entry-tile__body">
          <view class="entry-tile__title">身体感受记录</view>
          <view class="entry-tile__desc">活动自如度、平衡感知</view>
        </view>
        <view class="entry-tile__arrow">›</view>
      </navigator>

      <navigator
        class="entry-tile"
        url="/pages/records/index"
        open-type="switchTab"
        aria-role="button"
        aria-label="查看训练记录"
      >
        <view class="entry-tile__body">
          <view class="entry-tile__title">训练记录</view>
          <view class="entry-tile__desc">完成次数与存疑标记</view>
        </view>
        <view class="entry-tile__arrow">›</view>
      </navigator>

      <navigator
        class="entry-tile"
        url="/pages/alerts/index"
        open-type="switchTab"
        aria-role="button"
        aria-label="查看风险预警"
      >
        <view class="entry-tile__body">
          <view class="entry-tile__title">风险预警</view>
          <view class="entry-tile__desc">预警级别与处理状态</view>
        </view>
        <view class="entry-tile__arrow">›</view>
      </navigator>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{overview}}" class="section">
    <view class="section-title">当前身份</view>
    <view class="card">
      <view class="identity">
        <view class="identity__body">
          <view class="card-title">{{overview.context.accountName}} · {{overview.context.identity}}</view>
          <view class="muted">{{overview.context.orgName}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="hint">当前展示账号关联的患者；切换患者功能尚未开放。</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
